Logic to Remember
Track the lowest buying price seen so far.
For every new price:
Calculate today's profit.
Update the maximum profit.
🧠 Memory Trick

"Buy at the minimum, sell today if profitable."

📌 Revision Note

Pattern: Running Minimum

minPrice = min(minPrice, price)
profit = price - minPrice
maxProfit = max(maxProfit, profit)
⏱️ Complexity
Approach	Time	Space
Nested Loops	O(n²)	O(1)
Running Minimum (Optimal)	O(n)	O(1)
